Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 23:51:25 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 65/66] Witch's Potion

New quest. Progress is varp 67 (hetty) through a server-only varbit: 0,
1 started, 2 ingredients given, 3 complete (drunk from the cauldron), the
values Quest Helper reads. Dialogue follows the OSRS Wiki transcript,
including the player's line for every combination of held ingredients.
The hand-in takes one of each in one transaction. Rewards: 1 QP, 325
Magic XP. Hetty's after-quest lines move from the Rimmington townsfolk
script into the quest.

The rat's tail comes from a new rat drop table with the usual quest gate
(quest_mode = "during"). With the default quest-requirements mode
(assume-completed) that gate never passes, so the tail only drops under
respect-progress or virtual-completions; our own server, which keeps
assume-completed, uses an NpcDeathKillHook on the quest stage instead.

Guesses: the journal text and the quest scroll item.

